{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u200bOne day, the illness came. But here, it never left.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped, the world was reshaped by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you've arrived at a long-quarantined city, <i>New Horizon</i>. The only work you could find is <i>Crow</i> \u2014 body collector. You'll do essential work, the Military assured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first day at the job has arrived. You force yourself awake, rising from the dreamless void of slumber.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who are you, Crow?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/38972417c2798c42c33f1b67dec870c0.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/38972417c2798c42c33f1b67dec870c0.webm?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/38972417c2798c42c33f1b67dec870c0.mp4?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crow's Requiem is a <i>cRPG meets survival game</i></strong> where\u00a0you are a licensed body collector navigating\u00a0a dystopian Pandemicpunk\u00a0world where every choice matters.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/58afb29cb47f8c92424cf30df129a715.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=796 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/58afb29cb47f8c92424cf30df129a715.webm?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/58afb29cb47f8c92424cf30df129a715.mp4?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80\u00a0Choose your <strong>Crow Archetype</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Receive <strong>Body Collection Requests</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80\u00a0Do the Work in the <strong>Collection Mini-Game\u00a0</strong>*condition may vary!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80\u00a0Explore the city of New Horizon in the MAP UI;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80\u00a0Meet its Citizens, ALLY with them \u2014 or EXPLOIT their trust.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Cultivate your Faction REPUTATION, unlocking new paths, items, and quests;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Carve your way towards more than 10 different endings, molded by you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The CROWS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are of a unique breed within the City, for you are not quarantined as others. This gives you a powerful and rare freedom. How will you use it? Who are you in the Plaguelands?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a Listener Crow,</strong> wielding empathy and curiosity;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a Whisperer Crow,</strong> armed with lies and charm;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>an Enforcer Crow,</strong> moved by strength and violence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/c4632aa91de399d38e28a4c78df6f912.avif?t=1759533062\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The COLLECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your training was fleeting, but you can surely handle the dead, right?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXAMINE</strong>: Analyze their condition<i> (click and hold)</i>;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEAL</strong>: hold the illness in the body\u00a0<i>(click and drag side to side)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLUG</strong>: plug\u00a0natural cavities \u00a0<i>(multi-click)</i>;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BAG</strong>: Then, bag them<i> (click and drag down)</i> and return to the truck.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*conditions may vary</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/23e25ab6f69177f4a13640777f5b8e92.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/23e25ab6f69177f4a13640777f5b8e92.webm?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/23e25ab6f69177f4a13640777f5b8e92.mp4?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once you're done, another dead awaits.</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Collect your payment</strong> at the Medical Center before the day's end;\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>upkeep</strong> is due, and the Taxman is more unavoidable than the\u00a0illness.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/599944db3160a738757fe06d6f1d8cc4.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=800 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/599944db3160a738757fe06d6f1d8cc4.webm?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/599944db3160a738757fe06d6f1d8cc4.mp4?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore New Horizon and its forgotten shopping malls, where believers search for holy signs on dirty napkins. Or, enter lawless compounds where a gun speaks louder than authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REMEMBER, COLLECTOR: you are one of the few  in this quarantined city who still see others face-to-face daily. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reach your requested collections, you will enter temples, compounds, barracks, and even stranger places. Be ready for anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/c8721fb700a7110231bc6414e25125ac.avif?t=1759533062\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The FACTIONS &amp; CITIZENS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with the Military Anarchist and Cultist factions</strong> who split control over the city. Do their bidding loyally or double-cross each fool who crosses your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/638a63506b1276dc1d91b48d9ad9fbf3.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/638a63506b1276dc1d91b48d9ad9fbf3.webm?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/638a63506b1276dc1d91b48d9ad9fbf3.mp4?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>mad cultists to corrupt officials, down-on-their-luck civilians to rebellious artistic anarchists</strong>,  each will see you through the filter of their plans and creeds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/e8e37a45297e39e97fa8135fbd4b70d6.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/e8e37a45297e39e97fa8135fbd4b70d6.webm?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/e8e37a45297e39e97fa8135fbd4b70d6.mp4?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your CHOICES &amp; JOURNEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city and its inhabitants will remember your actions, so choose carefully how you'll deal with favors and threats, friend and foe. Carve your way towards multiple endings where you are the driving force of unforgettable consequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/e70a54ecd6e490e34b628e9154a42d1c.avif?t=1759533062\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your choices heal the world, make it better?<br>Or will you stoke the sickly flames of the end, breaking it beyond all repair?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city echoes through half-empty streets...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who are you, Crow?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/1fb4e7131c7acd990c3150f3291d6598.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/1fb4e7131c7acd990c3150f3291d6598.webm?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/1fb4e7131c7acd990c3150f3291d6598.mp4?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859230?t=1759533062","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/41bed6e3bcf2063d4351156afa5b2b47219d64ae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759533062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/1bec3dc6f18ee65c375b404ebaec0d221f00b5e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759533062","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/1bec3dc6f18ee65c375b404ebaec0d221f00b5e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759533062","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains violent, quarantine, pandemic, political, religious, physical and mental health, and death themes. While this content is included purposefully for narrative and experiential reasons, we encourage players' discretion."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u200bOne day, the illness came. But here, it never left.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped, the world was reshaped by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you've arrived at a long-quarantined city, <i>New Horizon</i>. The only work you could find is <i>Crow</i> \u2014 body collector. You'll do essential work, the Military assured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first day at the job has arrived. You force yourself awake, rising from the dreamless void of slumber.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who are you, Crow?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/38972417c2798c42c33f1b67dec870c0.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/38972417c2798c42c33f1b67dec870c0.webm?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/38972417c2798c42c33f1b67dec870c0.mp4?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crow's Requiem is a <i>cRPG meets survival game</i></strong> where\u00a0you are a licensed body collector navigating\u00a0a dystopian Pandemicpunk\u00a0world where every choice matters.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/58afb29cb47f8c92424cf30df129a715.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=796 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230