 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/599944db3160a738757fe06d6f1d8cc4.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=800 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/599944db3160a738757fe06d6f1d8cc4.webm?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/599944db3160a738757fe06d6f1d8cc4.mp4?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore New Horizon and its forgotten shopping malls, where believers search for holy signs on dirty napkins. Or, enter lawless compounds where a gun speaks louder than authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REMEMBER, COLLECTOR: you are one of the few  in this quarantined city who still see others face-to-face daily. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reach your requested collections, you will enter temples, compounds, barracks, and even stranger places. Be ready for anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/c8721fb700a7110231bc6414e25125ac.avif?t=1759533062\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The FACTIONS &amp; CITIZENS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with the Military Anarchist and Cultist factions</strong> who split control over the city. Do their bidding loyally or double-cross each fool who crosses your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/638a63506b1276dc1d91b48d9ad9fbf3.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/638a63506b1276dc1d91b48d9ad9fbf3.webm?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/638a63506b1276dc1d91b48d9ad9fbf3.mp4?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>mad cultists to corrupt officials, down-on-their-luck civilians to rebellious artistic anarchists</strong>,  each will see you through the filter of their plans and creeds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/e8e37a45297e39e97fa8135fbd4b70d6.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/e8e37a45297e39e97fa8135fbd4b70d6.webm?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/e8e37a45297e39e97fa8135fbd4b70d6.mp4?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your CHOICES &amp; JOURNEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city and its inhabitants will remember your actions, so choose carefully how you'll deal with favors and threats, friend and foe. Carve your way towards multiple endings where you are the driving force of unforgettable consequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/e70a54ecd6e490e34b628e9154a42d1c.avif?t=1759533062\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your choices heal the world, make it better?<br>Or will you stoke the sickly flames of the end, breaking it beyond all repair?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city echoes through half-empty streets...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who are you, Crow?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/1fb4e7131c7acd990c3150f3291d6598.poster.avif?t=1759533062\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/1fb4e7131c7acd990c3150f3291d6598.webm?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/extras/1fb4e7131c7acd990c3150f3291d6598.mp4?t=1759533062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Ex Ignorantia"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859230/b62a84504ada67bd8efc71da1469c28292f33527/header.jpg?t=1759533062","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859230/599435922/23a36cad480ed4f709b97cb6fef3d13f2441de5d/1759429283/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759430446","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859230/599435922/23a36cad480ed4f709b97cb6fef3d13f2441de5d/1759429283/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759430446","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859230/599435922/23a36cad480ed4f709b97cb6fef3d13f2441de5d/1759429283/hls_264_master.m3u8